<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" class="h-full">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Main Challenges of Machine Learning - Presentation Platform</title>
    <!-- Tailwind CSS -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <!-- Inter & Fira Code Fonts -->
    <link
        href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800;900&family=Fira+Code:wght@400;500;600&display=swap"
        rel="stylesheet">
    <!-- FontAwesome Icons -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">

    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            darkMode: 'class',
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    fontFamily: {
                        sans: ['Inter', 'sans-serif'],
                        mono: ['Fira Code', 'monospace'],
                    },
                    colors: {
                        brand: {
                            50: '#fff7ed',
                            100: '#ffedd5',
                            200: '#fed7aa',
                            500: '#ea580c',  /* Aditya Orange primary accent */
                            600: '#1e3a8a',  /* Aditya University Deep Blue */
                            700: '#1d4ed8',
                            900: '#172554',
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    </script>
    <style>
        ::-webkit-scrollbar {
            width: 8px;
            height: 8px;
        }

        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
            background: transparent;
        }

        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
            background: rgba(30, 58, 138, 0.2);
            border-radius: 6px;
        }

        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {
            background: rgba(234, 88, 12, 0.4);
        }

        .slide-enter {
            opacity: 0;
            transform: scale(0.98) translateY(10px);
            transition: all 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
        }

        .slide-active {
            opacity: 1;
            transform: scale(1) translateY(0);
            transition: all 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
        }

        @keyframes pulse-ring {
            0% {
                transform: scale(0.96);
                opacity: 0.6;
            }

            50% {
                transform: scale(1.08);
                opacity: 0.9;
            }

            100% {
                transform: scale(0.96);
                opacity: 0.6;
            }
        }

        .pulse-element {
            animation: pulse-ring 3s infinite ease-in-out;
        }

        /* Fullscreen Hidden Elements (Disappears automatically when in fullscreen mode) */
        :fullscreen #outline-sidebar,
        :-webkit-full-screen #outline-sidebar,
        :fullscreen #notes-sidebar,
        :-webkit-full-screen #notes-sidebar,
        :fullscreen #header-controls,
        :-webkit-full-screen #header-controls,
        :fullscreen #footer-controls,
        :-webkit-full-screen #footer-controls,
        .pseudo-fullscreen #outline-sidebar,
        .pseudo-fullscreen #notes-sidebar,
        .pseudo-fullscreen #header-controls,
        .pseudo-fullscreen #footer-controls {
            display: none !important;
            width: 0 !important;
            height: 0 !important;
            overflow: hidden !important;
            padding: 0 !important;
            border: none !important;
            margin: 0 !important;
        }

        :fullscreen #slide-viewport,
        :-webkit-full-screen #slide-viewport {
            max-width: 100vw !important;
            max-height: calc(100vh - 200px) !important;
            /* Reserve height space for Header & Footers */
            width: 100% !important;
            height: 100% !important;
            border: none !important;
            border-radius: 0px !important;
            background-color: #ffffff !important;
            /* Clean light background for full-screen slide projection */
        }

        /* High-fidelity Fallback when Native Fullscreen is blocked by IFrame Permissions Policy */
        .pseudo-fullscreen #slide-viewport {
            position: fixed !important;
            top: 0 !important;
            left: 0 !important;
            width: 100vw !important;
            height: 100vh !important;
            max-width: 100vw !important;
            max-height: 100vh !important;
            z-index: 9999 !important;
            border: none !important;
            border-radius: 0px !important;
            background-color: #ffffff !important;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body class="h-full bg-slate-50 text-slate-800 font-sans overflow-hidden">

    <div class="h-full flex flex-col">
        <!-- Control Header -->
        <header
            class="bg-white border-b border-slate-200 px-8 py-4 flex flex-wrap justify-between items-center gap-4 z-10 shrink-0 shadow-sm">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
                <img src="https://www.facultyplus.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Aditya-university-logo.webp"
                    alt="Aditya University Logo"
                    onerror="this.src='https://placehold.co/150x50/1e3a8a/ffffff?text=Aditya+University'"
                    class="h-12 md:h-14 w-auto object-contain p-1 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 shadow-sm bg-white">
                <div>
                    <h1 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-black tracking-tight text-brand-600 flex items-center gap-3">
                        Main Challenges of Machine Learning
                        <span
                            class="text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-orange-100 text-brand-500 border border-orange-200 tracking-wider">CO1
                            Mapping</span>
                    </h1>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 font-medium font-mono">Unit-I Core Engineering Challenges & Model
                        Failures</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-center gap-4 flex-wrap">
                <!-- Modes and Shortcut Controls (Disappears in Fullscreen) -->
                <div id="header-controls" class="flex items-center gap-4 flex-wrap">
                    <!-- Modes Toggle -->
                    <div
                        class="bg-slate-100 rounded-xl p-1 border border-slate-200 flex items-center gap-1 shadow-inner">
                        <button id="btn-student-mode" onclick="toggleMode('student')"
                            class="px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-semibold transition duration-200 flex items-center gap-2 text-brand-500 bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-graduation-cap text-orange-500"></i> Student Guide
                        </button>
                        <button id="btn-teacher-mode" onclick="toggleMode('teacher')"
                            class="px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-semibold transition duration-200 flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-chalkboard-user"></i> Lecture Notes
                        </button>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Shortcuts Help -->
                    <button onclick="toggleHelpModal()"
                        class="px-4 py-2 bg-white hover:bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 transition duration-150 flex items-center gap-2">
                        <i class="fa-regular fa-keyboard text-brand-500"></i> Hotkeys
                    </button>
                </div>

                <!-- Fullscreen Button -->
                <button onclick="toggleFullscreen()"
                    class="p-2.5 bg-white hover:bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl text-slate-700 transition duration-150"
                    title="Toggle Fullscreen (F)">
                    <i id="fullscreen-icon" class="fa-solid fa-expand"></i>
                </button>
            </div>
        </header>

        <main class="flex-1 flex overflow-hidden relative">

            <!-- Left Outline Sidebar -->
            <aside id="outline-sidebar"
                class="w-80 bg-slate-100 border-r border-slate-200 flex flex-col transition-all duration-300 shrink-0">
                <div class="p-5 border-b border-slate-200 flex justify-between items-center bg-white">
                    <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-500">Lecture Outline</span>
                    <span
                        class="text-xs bg-slate-200 px-2.5 py-1 rounded border border-slate-300 font-mono font-bold text-slate-700"
                        id="slide-ratio-counter">Slide 1 / 14</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex-1 overflow-y-auto p-3 space-y-1" id="outline-list">
                    <!-- Dynamic rendering of slides -->
                </div>
            </aside>

            <!-- Center Stage Slide Viewport -->
            <div class="flex-1 flex flex-col bg-slate-50 overflow-hidden relative">
                <!-- Outer slide frame mimicking projection screen -->
                <div class="flex-1 flex items-center justify-center p-6 lg:p-10 overflow-hidden">
                    <div id="slide-viewport"
                        class="group/viewport w-full max-w-7xl bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl shadow-xl flex flex-col min-h-[640px] max-h-[85vh] transition-all relative overflow-hidden">

                        <!-- Floating Zoom & Pan Controls -->
                        <div id="zoom-controls-panel"
                            class="absolute top-4 left-4 z-40 bg-white/95 border border-slate-200 p-1.5 rounded-xl flex items-center gap-2 shadow-md opacity-0 group-hover/viewport:opacity-100 group-hover/viewport:pointer-events-auto focus-within:opacity-100 focus-within:pointer-events-auto transition-all duration-300">
                            <span
                                class="text-[10px] font-mono font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest pl-1">Zoom:</span>
                            <button onclick="adjustZoom(0.1)"
                                class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-slate-50 hover:bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold transition"
                                title="Zoom In">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i>
                            </button>
                            <span id="zoom-factor-indicator"
                                class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-brand-500 min-w-[36px] text-center">100%</span>
                            <button onclick="adjustZoom(-0.1)"
                                class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-slate-50 hover:bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold transition"
                                title="Zoom Out">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-minus"></i>
                            </button>
                            <button onclick="resetZoom()"
                                class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-slate-50 hover:bg-slate-100 text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-800 flex items-center justify-center text-[10px] transition"
                                title="Reset Zoom">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-rotate-left"></i>
                            </button>
                            <div class="w-px h-5 bg-slate-200"></div>
                            <button id="btn-pan-mode" onclick="togglePanMode()"
                                class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-slate-50 hover:bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 flex items-center justify-center text-[11px] transition"
                                title="Toggle Pan Grab Tool (Or hold Shift)">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-hand"></i>
                            </button>
                        </div>

                        <!-- ZOOMABLE INNER CONTAINER FRAME -->
                        <div class="flex-1 relative overflow-hidden bg-white" id="viewport-content-frame">
                            <div id="zoom-content-wrapper"
                                class="w-full h-full absolute inset-0 origin-center transition-transform duration-100 ease-out flex flex-col justify-center">

                                <!-- Whiteboard Drawing Overlay Canvas -->
                                <canvas id="whiteboard-canvas"
                                    class="absolute inset-0 z-20 pointer-events-none bg-transparent"></canvas>

                                <!-- Whitepaper overlay for drawing -->
                                <div id="whitepaper-overlay"
                                    class="absolute inset-0 bg-white z-10 hidden flex flex-col items-center justify-center pointer-events-none select-none">
                                    <div class="text-center space-y-4 max-w-md px-6">
                                        <div
                                            class="w-20 h-20 rounded-full bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto shadow-inner text-brand-500">
                                            <i class="fa-solid fa-pen-ruler text-4xl animate-pulse"></i>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="space-y-2">
                                            <h3
                                                class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900 uppercase tracking-widest font-mono">
                                                Whitepaper Workspace</h3>
                                            <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">This is a blank drawing
                                                board. Select your preferred pen color below and sketch freely over this
                                                projection window.</p>
                                        </div>
                                        <div
                                            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 text-xs text-slate-600 font-mono">
                                            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 animate-pulse"></span>
                                            Interactive Drawing Mode Enabled
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>

                                <!-- Laser Pointer element -->
                                <div id="laser-pointer"
                                    class="absolute w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-rose-600/95 shadow-[0_0_20px_6px_#ef4444] pointer-events-none z-30 hidden -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 mix-blend-multiply">
                                </div>

                                <!-- DYNAMIC SLIDE CONTENT VIEW -->
                                <div class="flex-1 p-8 md:p-12 overflow-y-auto flex flex-col justify-center"
                                    id="slide-stage">
                                    <!-- Injected slide elements -->
                                </div>

                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Floating Presentation Tools Overlay Palette -->
                        <div id="presentation-tools-palette"
                            class="absolute bottom-4 right-4 bg-white/95 border border-slate-200 px-3.5 py-2 rounded-xl flex items-center gap-3 z-40 shadow-md hidden">
                            <span
                                class="text-[10px] font-mono font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-widest">Draw:</span>
                            <button onclick="setWhiteboardColor('#ef4444')"
                                class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-rose-500 border-2 border-white/80 hover:scale-110 transition"
                                title="Red"></button>
                            <button onclick="setWhiteboardColor('#10b981')"
                                class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 border-2 border-white/80 hover:scale-110 transition"
                                title="Green"></button>
                            <button onclick="setWhiteboardColor('#1e3a8a')"
                                class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-blue-900 border-2 border-white/80 hover:scale-110 transition"
                                title="Blue"></button>
                            <button onclick="setWhiteboardColor('#1e293b')"
                                class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-slate-800 border-2 border-white/80 hover:scale-110 transition"
                                title="Slate (Dark)"></button>
                            <div class="w-px h-5 bg-slate-200"></div>
                            <button onclick="clearWhiteboard()"
                                class="p-1.5 bg-slate-50 hover:bg-slate-100 text-rose-600 hover:text-rose-500 rounded-lg text-xs font-bold font-mono border border-slate-200 flex items-center gap-1">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-eraser"></i> Clear
                            </button>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Slide Top Indicators (Category & Progress) -->
                        <div
                            class="px-8 py-4 border-b border-slate-200 flex justify-between items-center bg-slate-50/50 select-none">
                            <div
                                class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm font-bold text-brand-500 tracking-wider uppercase">
                                <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-brand-500 inline-block animate-pulse"></span>
                                <span id="slide-category">Loading...</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-mono font-bold" id="slide-index-indicator">SLIDE 01
                                OF 14</div>
                        </div>

                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Footer Navigation Panel (Disappears in Fullscreen to keep view clean) -->
                <footer id="footer-controls"
                    class="bg-white border-t border-slate-200 px-8 py-5 flex justify-between items-center gap-4 shrink-0 shadow-sm select-none">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                        <button onclick="prevSlide()"
                            class="px-5 py-2.5 bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl text-base text-slate-800 transition font-bold flex items-center gap-2.5 disabled:opacity-30 disabled:cursor-not-allowed"
                            id="btn-prev">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left"></i> Prev
                        </button>
                        <button onclick="nextSlide()"
                            class="px-5 py-2.5 bg-brand-600 hover:bg-brand-600/90 border border-blue-800 rounded-xl text-base text-white transition font-bold flex items-center gap-2.5 disabled:opacity-30 disabled:cursor-not-allowed"
                            id="btn-next">
                            Next <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i>
                        </button>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Slide Progress Slider -->
                    <div class="flex-1 max-w-xl hidden md:flex items-center gap-4">
                        <span class="text-sm text-slate-400 font-mono font-bold">01</span>
                        <input type="range" id="slide-progress" min="0" max="13" value="0"
                            class="w-full h-1.5 bg-slate-200 rounded-lg appearance-none cursor-pointer accent-brand-500"
                            oninput="jumpToSlide(parseInt(this.value))">
                        <span class="text-sm text-slate-400 font-mono font-bold">14</span>
                    </div>

                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                        <!-- Whitepaper Toggle -->
                        <button id="btn-whitepaper-toggle" onclick="toggleWhitepaperMode()"
                            class="px-4 py-2 bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 transition duration-150 flex items-center gap-2"
                            title="Toggle blank drawing canvas">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-chalkboard text-emerald-600"></i> Whitepaper
                        </button>

                        <!-- Laser Pointer Toggle -->
                        <button id="btn-laser" onclick="toggleLaserPointer()"
                            class="px-4 py-2 bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 transition duration-150 flex items-center gap-2"
                            title="Toggle Laser Pointer">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-circle text-rose-500 text-xs"></i> Laser
                        </button>

                        <!-- Whiteboard Pen Toggle -->
                        <button id="btn-whiteboard" onclick="toggleWhiteboard()"
                            class="px-4 py-2 bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 transition duration-150 flex items-center gap-2"
                            title="Toggle Whiteboard Drawing">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-pen-fancy text-sky-600"></i> Draw
                        </button>

                        <!-- Toggle Sidebar Outline -->
                        <button onclick="toggleSidebar()"
                            class="px-4 py-2 bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 transition duration-150 flex items-center gap-2">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-bars-staggered"></i> Outline
                        </button>

                        <!-- Toggle Presenter Notes Sidebar -->
                        <button id="btn-toggle-notes" onclick="toggleNotesSidebar()"
                            class="px-4 py-2 bg-orange-50 hover:bg-orange-100 border border-orange-200 rounded-xl text-sm font-semibold text-brand-500 transition duration-150 flex items-center gap-2">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-graduation-cap"></i> Sidebar
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </footer>

                <!-- Symmetrical Academic Sub-Footer -->
                <div
                    class="bg-slate-200 border-t border-slate-300 px-8 py-3 flex justify-between items-center text-xs md:text-sm text-slate-600 font-semibold shrink-0 tracking-wide select-none shadow-inner">
                    <div id="academic-footer-date" class="w-1/4 text-left font-mono">July 2026</div>
                    <div id="academic-footer-topic"
                        class="w-2/5 text-center truncate font-bold text-brand-600 uppercase tracking-wider">Unit-I:
                        Challenges of Machine Learning</div>
                    <div class="w-1/4 text-center text-slate-700 font-mono">Mr. M. Subrahmanyam, Asst. Prof., AIML</div>
                    <div id="academic-footer-page" class="w-1/4 text-right font-mono text-slate-500">Slide 1 / 14</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Notes / Simulator Sidebar -->
            <aside id="notes-sidebar"
                class="w-[480px] bg-white border-l border-slate-200 flex flex-col transition-all duration-300 shrink-0 shadow-md">
                <div class="p-1.5 border-b border-slate-200 flex bg-slate-50">
                    <button id="tab-notes" onclick="setActiveTab('notes')"
                        class="flex-1 py-2.5 text-center text-xs font-bold rounded-lg transition duration-200 bg-white text-brand-600 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
                        <i class="fa-regular fa-comment-dots mr-1.5 text-brand-500"></i> Lecture Guides
                    </button>
                    <button id="tab-sandbox" onclick="setActiveTab('sandbox')"
                        class="flex-1 py-2.5 text-center text-xs font-bold rounded-lg transition duration-200 text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-800">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-flask-vial mr-1.5 text-brand-500"></i> Interactive Lab Sandbox
                    </button>
                </div>

                <!-- Tab content container -->
                <div class="flex-1 overflow-y-auto p-6 space-y-6">

                    <!-- NOTES PANEL -->
                    <div id="notes-content" class="space-y-6">
                        <div class="bg-slate-50 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 space-y-3">
                            <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-500">Active
                                Speaker Note</span>
                            <p id="speaker-note-text" class="text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
                                Loading notes...</p>
                        </div>

                        <div class="bg-slate-50 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 space-y-3">
                            <span
                                class="text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-emerald-600">Real-World
                                Case Study</span>
                            <p id="slide-example-text" class="text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
                                Loading cases...</p>
                        </div>

                        <div class="bg-slate-50 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 space-y-3">
                            <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-sky-600">Live
                                Classroom Interaction</span>
                            <p id="slide-interaction-text" class="text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
                                Loading prompt...</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- SANDBOX PANEL -->
                    <div id="sandbox-content" class="hidden space-y-6">
                        <div class="bg-slate-50 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 space-y-4">
                            <span
                                class="text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-500 block">Generalization
                                Simulator (Under vs Overfit)</span>
                            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">Click in the white plotting area below to
                                add coordinates. Choose different fitting models to see how they capture structural
                                trends or memorize noise.</p>

                            <!-- Drawing Canvas for Polynomial Overfitting Sandbox -->
                            <div
                                class="relative w-full aspect-square bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200 overflow-hidden shadow-inner">
                                <canvas id="sandbox-plot-canvas"
                                    class="w-full h-full cursor-crosshair bg-white"></canvas>
                            </div>

                            <div class="flex gap-2">
                                <button onclick="setSandboxModel('linear')" id="btn-sb-linear"
                                    class="flex-1 py-2 rounded-lg text-xs font-bold border border-slate-300 bg-white text-slate-700 shadow-sm">Linear
                                    Fit (Underfit)</button>
                                <button onclick="setSandboxModel('quadratic')" id="btn-sb-quad"
                                    class="flex-1 py-2 rounded-lg text-xs font-bold border border-slate-300 bg-white text-slate-700 shadow-sm">Quadratic
                                    Fit (Target)</button>
                                <button onclick="setSandboxModel('overfit')" id="btn-sb-overfit"
                                    class="flex-1 py-2 rounded-lg text-xs font-bold border border-orange-200 bg-orange-50 text-brand-500 shadow-sm">High
                                    Poly Fit (Overfit)</button>
                            </div>

                            <div class="flex gap-2">
                                <button onclick="clearSandboxPoints()"
                                    class="flex-1 py-2 text-xs font-bold bg-white hover:bg-slate-50 rounded-lg text-rose-600 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">Reset
                                    Coordinates</button>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Statistical Sampling Bias & Error Simulator -->
                        <div class="bg-slate-50 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 space-y-4">
                            <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-sky-600 block">Data
                                Volume & Generalization Gap Solver</span>
                            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">Simulate how sample volume (N) and target
                                error parameters interact to establish mathematical generalization limits.</p>

                            <div class="space-y-3">
                                <div>
                                    <label class="text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-500 flex justify-between">
                                        <span>Sample Size (N)</span>
                                        <span id="sb-slider-n-val" class="text-brand-500 font-bold">1500</span>
                                    </label>
                                    <input type="range" id="sb-slider-n" min="100" max="10000" step="100" value="1500"
                                        oninput="updateBoundPlot()"
                                        class="w-full h-1.5 bg-slate-200 rounded-lg accent-brand-500">
                                </div>
                                <div>
                                    <label class="text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-500 flex justify-between">
                                        <span>Tolerance Error Threshold (&epsilon;)</span>
